ications for CRISPR/Cas9 interrogation of the malaria parasite genome.</AbstractText><CopyrightInformation>&#xa9; The Author(s) 2019. Published by Oxford University Press.</CopyrightInformation></Abstract><AuthorList CompleteYN="Y"><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Lee</LastName><ForeName>Marcus C S</ForeName><Initials>MCS</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Parasites and Microbes Programme, Wellcome Sanger Institute, Hinxton, UK.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Lindner</LastName><ForeName>Scott E</ForeName><Initials>SE</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology, Huck Center for Malaria Research, The Pennsylvania State University, Pennsylvania, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Lopez-Rubio</LastName><ForeName>Jose-Juan</ForeName><Initials>JJ</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Dynamique des Interactions Membranaires Normales et Pathologiques, UMR5235 CNRS, INSERM, Universit&#xe9; Montpellier, Montpellier, France.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author><Author ValidYN="Y"><LastName>Llin&#xe1;s</LastName><ForeName>Manuel</ForeName><Initials>M</Initials><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology, Huck Center for Malaria Research, The Pennsylvania State University, Pennsylvania, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo><AffiliationInfo><Affiliation>Department of Chemistry, The Pennsylvania State University, Pennsylvania, USA.</Affiliation></AffiliationInfo></Author></AuthorList><Language>eng</Language><GrantList CompleteYN="Y"><Grant><Acronym>WT_</Acronym><Agency>Wellcome Trust</Agency><Country>United Kingdom</Country></Grant><Grant><GrantID>R01 AI125565</GrantID><Acronym>AI</Acronym><Agency>NIAID NIH HHS</Agency><Country>United States</Country></Grant><Grant><GrantID>R21 AI130692</GrantID><Acronym>AI</Acronym><Agency>NIAID NIH HHS</Agency><Country>United States</Country></Grant><Grant><GrantID>206194</GrantID><